<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Semicon Feb sales down 28.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Semicon Feb sales down 28.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co said on Friday its February sales revenue dropped 28.8 percent to T$2.274 billion from T$3.193 billion in February 1996.</p>
<p>For the first two months of 1997, Taiwan Semiconductor posted a sales total of T$4.806 billion, down 26.3 percent from T$6.522 billion in the same period in 1996, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give reasons for the sales decline.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
